        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86664, Rustic Modern Sandcast Bronze Edge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Rustic Modern Edge Pull can be mounted horizontally or vertically for use on kitchen cabinet doors or drawers. The Rustic Modern Sandcast Bronze Edge Pull is available in 3 finishes: flat black bronze, medium bronze, and tumbled white bronze. Choose from small, medium, and large sized Hidden Cabinet Pulls. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Sandcast Bronze Hidden Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86664-specifications.pdf?v=1704262414\"><b>Emtek Rustic Modern Edge Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86664: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip length: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86665: Medium</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip length: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86666: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip length: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
